window.GRAMMAR={"topics":[{"id":"to-be","title":"to be (am/is/are)","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"Болуу этиши: am / is / are","when_ky":"to be этиши «болуу, экен» дегенди билдирет. Өзүбүз же башка адам жөнүндө айтканда колдонобуз: ким экенибизди, канча жашта экенибизди, кайда экенибизди.","form":[["+","I am / You are / He, She, It is / We, You, They are"],["-","I am not / is not (isn't) / are not (aren't)"],["?","Am I...? / Is he...? / Are you...?"]],"rule_ky":"I менен am, he/she/it менен is, we/you/they менен are колдонулат. Кыска формасы: I'm, you're, he's, she's, it's, we're, they're. Терс сүйлөмдө to be этишинен кийин not коюлат. Суроодо этиш сүйлөмдүн башына чыгат: Are you a student? Жообу: Yes, I am. / No, I'm not.","signal":["I am","you are","he is","she is","they are"],"examples":[{"en":"I am Aibek. I am 12.","ky":"Мен Айбекмин. Мен 12 жаштамын."},{"en":"She is a teacher.","ky":"Ал (аял) мугалим."},{"en":"We are from Kyrgyzstan.","ky":"Биз Кыргызстандан болобуз."},{"en":"Is he at home?","ky":"Ал үйдөбү?"},{"en":"They aren't students.","ky":"Алар студент эмес."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I is a student.","right":"I am a student.","why_ky":"I менен is эмес, am колдонулат."},{"wrong":"She are happy.","right":"She is happy.","why_ky":"She менен are эмес, is колдонулат."},{"wrong":"You is my friend.","right":"You are my friend.","why_ky":"You менен дайыма are колдонулат."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ ten years old.","options":["am","is","are"],"answer":"am"},{"q":"She ___ my sister.","options":["am","is","are"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"They ___ in the park.","options":["am","is","are"],"answer":"are"},{"q":"We ___ students.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":"are"},{"q":"He ___ a doctor.","options":["are","am","is"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"___ you from Bishkek?","options":["Am","Is","Are"],"answer":"Are"},{"q":"It ___ a cat.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"I ___ not tired.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":"am"},{"q":"My parents ___ at work.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":"are"},{"q":"___ she your teacher?","options":["Is","Are","Am"],"answer":"Is"}],"speak":["Tell me your name, age and country: I am...","Ask your friend: Are you...? Is your mother...?"]},{"id":"articles","title":"Articles: a / an / the","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"Артикль: a / an / the","when_ky":"Артикль англис тилинде зат атоочтун алдында турат. a/an бир нерсе жөнүндө биринчи жолу айтканда, the белгилүү нерсе жөнүндө айтканда колдонулат.","form":[["a","a + үнсүз үн менен башталган сөз: a book, a dog"],["an","an + үндүү үн менен башталган сөз: an apple, an egg"],["the","the + белгилүү нерсе: the sun, the book on the table"]],"rule_ky":"a жана an «бир» дегенди билдирет жана жалгыз сандагы санала турган зат атоочтун алдына коюлат. Сөз үндүү үн (a, e, i, o, u) менен башталса an, болбосо a колдонобуз: an orange, a car. The — тыңдоочу кайсы нерсе экенин билсе, же нерсе жалгыз болсо (the sun, the moon). Көптүк санда жана жалпы айтканда артикль коюлбайт: I like dogs.","signal":["a / an","the","first time","already known"],"examples":[{"en":"I have a dog. The dog is big.","ky":"Менин итим бар. Ит чоң."},{"en":"She eats an apple every day.","ky":"Ал күн сайын алма жейт."},{"en":"He is an engineer.","ky":"Ал инженер."},{"en":"Open the window, please.","ky":"Терезени ачыңызчы."},{"en":"The sun is hot.","ky":"Күн ысык."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"She has a orange.","right":"She has an orange.","why_ky":"orange үндүү үн менен башталат, ошондуктан an."},{"wrong":"I like the dogs. (жалпы)","right":"I like dogs.","why_ky":"Жалпы айтканда артикль керек эмес."},{"wrong":"He is engineer.","right":"He is an engineer.","why_ky":"Кесиптин алдында a/an коюлат."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I have ___ apple.","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":"an"},{"q":"She is ___ teacher.","options":["an","a","the"],"answer":"a"},{"q":"___ sun is bright today.","options":["A","An","The"],"answer":"The"},{"q":"He has ___ umbrella.","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":"an"},{"q":"This is ___ egg.","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":"an"},{"q":"I see ___ cat. ___ cat is black.","options":["a / The","the / A","an / The"],"answer":"a / The"},{"q":"It is ___ interesting book.","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":"an"},{"q":"My father is ___ driver.","options":["an","a","the"],"answer":"a"},{"q":"Close ___ door, please. (we know which door)","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":"the"},{"q":"She wants ___ orange juice.","options":["a","an","the"],"answer":"an"}],"speak":["Say what you have in your bag: I have a... and an...","Describe your room using a/an and the."]},{"id":"plural-nouns","title":"Plural nouns","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"Көптүк сандагы зат атоочтор","when_ky":"Бирден көп нерсе жөнүндө айтканда зат атоочтун көптүк формасын колдонобуз: two books, three cats.","form":[["+s","book - books, cat - cats"],["+es","bus - buses, box - boxes, watch - watches"],["y → ies","baby - babies, city - cities"]],"rule_ky":"Көпчүлүк сөздөргө -s кошобуз. -s, -x, -ch, -sh менен бүткөн сөздөргө -es кошобуз: box - boxes. Үнсүз + y менен бүтсө, y ордуна -ies: baby - babies. -f/-fe менен бүтсө: knife - knives. Туура эмес көптүктөр жаттоону талап кылат: man - men, woman - women, child - children, foot - feet, tooth - teeth, person - people.","signal":["two","three","many","some"],"examples":[{"en":"I have two brothers.","ky":"Менин эки агам (иним) бар."},{"en":"There are three boxes on the table.","ky":"Столдун үстүндө үч куту бар."},{"en":"The children are in the garden.","ky":"Балдар бакчада."},{"en":"Those women are teachers.","ky":"Ал аялдар мугалимдер."},{"en":"My feet are cold.","ky":"Буттарым муздак."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"two childs","right":"two children","why_ky":"child - туура эмес көптүк: children."},{"wrong":"three boxs","right":"three boxes","why_ky":"-x менен бүткөн сөзгө -es кошулат."},{"wrong":"a lot of persons","right":"a lot of people","why_ky":"person - people болуп өзгөрөт."}],"exercises":[{"q":"one cat - two ___","options":["cats","cates","caties"],"answer":"cats"},{"q":"one box - three ___","options":["boxs","boxes","boxies"],"answer":"boxes"},{"q":"one baby - two ___","options":["babys","babies","babyes"],"answer":"babies"},{"q":"one man - two ___","options":["mans","men","manes"],"answer":"men"},{"q":"one child - four ___","options":["childs","children","childrens"],"answer":"children"},{"q":"one watch - two ___","options":["watchs","watches","watchies"],"answer":"watches"},{"q":"one tooth - many ___","options":["tooths","teeth","teethes"],"answer":"teeth"},{"q":"one city - five ___","options":["citys","cities","cityes"],"answer":"cities"},{"q":"one woman - two ___","options":["womans","womens","women"],"answer":"women"},{"q":"one knife - three ___","options":["knifes","knives","knifs"],"answer":"knives"}],"speak":["Count things in your classroom: two windows, ... chairs.","Say the plural of: child, foot, person."]},{"id":"this-that","title":"this / that / these / those","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"this / that / these / those (көрсөтүү ат атоочтору)","when_ky":"Нерсени же адамды көрсөткөндө колдонобуз. this/these жакын нерсе үчүн, that/those алыс нерсе үчүн.","form":[["жакын","this (1) / these (көп)"],["алыс","that (1) / those (көп)"],["?","Is this...? / Are those...?"]],"rule_ky":"This — жакындагы бир нерсе: this pen. These — жакындагы бир нече нерсе: these pens. That — алыстагы бир нерсе: that house. Those — алыстагы бир нече нерсе: those houses. This/that менен is, these/those менен are колдонулат: This is my bag. Those are my friends.","signal":["here","there","near","far"],"examples":[{"en":"This is my book.","ky":"Бул менин китебим."},{"en":"That is my school.","ky":"Тигил менин мектебим."},{"en":"These are my shoes.","ky":"Булар менин бутинкелерим."},{"en":"Those are big mountains.","ky":"Тигилер чоң тоолор."},{"en":"Is this your pen?","ky":"Бул сенин калемиңби?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"This are my friends.","right":"These are my friends.","why_ky":"Көптүктө these колдонулат."},{"wrong":"Those is a bird.","right":"That is a bird.","why_ky":"Бир нерсе болсо that, ал менен is."},{"wrong":"That books are new.","right":"Those books are new.","why_ky":"Көптүк зат атооч менен those."}],"exercises":[{"q":"___ is my pencil. (in my hand)","options":["This","These","Those"],"answer":"This"},{"q":"___ are my parents. (near me)","options":["This","That","These"],"answer":"These"},{"q":"___ is a big tree. (far away)","options":["That","Those","These"],"answer":"That"},{"q":"___ are birds. (far away, many)","options":["That","Those","This"],"answer":"Those"},{"q":"Is ___ your bag? (near)","options":["these","this","those"],"answer":"this"},{"q":"Are ___ your shoes? (far, many)","options":["that","this","those"],"answer":"those"},{"q":"___ apples are red. (near)","options":["This","These","That"],"answer":"These"},{"q":"Look at ___ mountain! (far, one)","options":["that","those","these"],"answer":"that"},{"q":"___ is my mother. (near)","options":["These","Those","This"],"answer":"This"},{"q":"___ are my books. (near)","options":["These","This","That"],"answer":"These"}],"speak":["Point at things in the room: This is... These are...","Point at things far away: That is... Those are..."]},{"id":"have-got","title":"have got / has got","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"have got / has got (менде бар)","when_ky":"Бирөөнүн бир нерсеси бар экенин айтканда колдонобуз: менин машинам бар, анын эки иниси бар.","form":[["+","I/You/We/They have got; He/She/It has got"],["-","haven't got / hasn't got"],["?","Have you got...? / Has she got...?"]],"rule_ky":"I, you, we, they менен have got, he, she, it менен has got колдонулат. Кыска формасы: I've got, she's got. Терс: I haven't got, he hasn't got. Суроо: Have you got a pen? Жообу: Yes, I have. / No, I haven't.","signal":["have got","has got","haven't got"],"examples":[{"en":"I have got a new phone.","ky":"Менин жаңы телефоном бар."},{"en":"She has got two sisters.","ky":"Анын эки эжеси (карындашы) бар."},{"en":"We haven't got a car.","ky":"Бизде машина жок."},{"en":"Has he got a dog?","ky":"Анын ити барбы?"},{"en":"They have got a big house.","ky":"Алардын чоң үйү бар."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"He have got a bike.","right":"He has got a bike.","why_ky":"he/she/it менен has got колдонулат."},{"wrong":"I has got a pen.","right":"I have got a pen.","why_ky":"I менен have got."},{"wrong":"Have she got a cat?","right":"Has she got a cat?","why_ky":"she менен Has."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ got a brother.","options":["has","have","am"],"answer":"have"},{"q":"She ___ got blue eyes.","options":["have","has","is"],"answer":"has"},{"q":"They ___ got a dog.","options":["has","have","are"],"answer":"have"},{"q":"___ you got a pen?","options":["Has","Have","Are"],"answer":"Have"},{"q":"___ he got a bike?","options":["Have","Has","Is"],"answer":"Has"},{"q":"We ___ got a car. (-)","options":["hasn't","haven't","aren't"],"answer":"haven't"},{"q":"My cat ___ got long ears.","options":["have","has","is"],"answer":"has"},{"q":"It ___ got four legs.","options":["have","has","are"],"answer":"has"},{"q":"My friends ___ got new phones.","options":["has","have","is"],"answer":"have"},{"q":"She ___ got a car. (-)","options":["haven't","hasn't","isn't"],"answer":"hasn't"}],"speak":["Tell what you have got at home.","Ask a friend: Have you got a brother or sister?"]},{"id":"can-cant","title":"can / can't","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"can / can't (кыла алуу)","when_ky":"can менен бир нерсени кыла алабыз же уруксат сурайбыз. can't — кыла албайбыз же уруксат жок дегенди билдирет.","form":[["+","subject + can + V1"],["-","subject + can't (cannot) + V1"],["?","Can + subject + V1?"]],"rule_ky":"can бардык жактар менен бирдей, he/she/it менен -s кошулбайт. can менен этиш өзгөрбөйт: she can swim (swims эмес). Суроодо can биринчи турат: Can you swim? Жообу: Yes, I can. / No, I can't. Уруксат сурап: Can I open the window?","signal":["can","can't","cannot"],"examples":[{"en":"I can swim.","ky":"Мен сүзө алам."},{"en":"She can't drive.","ky":"Ал машина айдай албайт."},{"en":"Can you speak English?","ky":"Сен англисче сүйлөй аласыңбы?"},{"en":"My brother can play the guitar.","ky":"Менин агам гитарада ойной алат."},{"en":"Can I come in?","ky":"Кирсем болобу?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"She cans swim.","right":"She can swim.","why_ky":"can менен -s кошулбайт."},{"wrong":"I can to run.","right":"I can run.","why_ky":"can менен to колдонулбайт."},{"wrong":"Can she swims?","right":"Can she swim?","why_ky":"can менен этиш V1 формасында болот."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ swim.","options":["can","cans","am can"],"answer":"can"},{"q":"She ___ play chess.","options":["can","cans","can to"],"answer":"can"},{"q":"A fish ___ walk.","options":["can","can't","cans"],"answer":"can't"},{"q":"A bird ___ fly.","options":["can","can't","cans"],"answer":"can"},{"q":"___ you speak English?","options":["Do","Can","Are"],"answer":"Can"},{"q":"They can ___ football.","options":["to play","plays","play"],"answer":"play"},{"q":"___ she dance? - Yes, she ___.","options":["Can / can","Does / can","Can / does"],"answer":"Can / can"},{"q":"A baby ___ read a book.","options":["can","can't","cans"],"answer":"can't"},{"q":"___ I open the window? (asking permission)","options":["Can","Do","Am"],"answer":"Can"},{"q":"He can ___ the piano.","options":["plays","to play","play"],"answer":"play"}],"speak":["Say 3 things you can do and 3 things you can't do.","Ask your friend: Can you cook? Can you swim?"]},{"id":"there-is-are","title":"there is / there are","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"there is / there are (бар экен)","when_ky":"Бир жерде бир нерсе же бир нече нерсе бар экенин айтканда колдонобуз.","form":[["+","There is + 1 зат / There are + көп зат"],["-","There isn't / There aren't"],["?","Is there...? / Are there...?"]],"rule_ky":"There is бир нерсе жана санап болбой турган нерселер үчүн: There is a book. There is water. There are көптүк үчүн: There are two books. Терс: There isn't a cat. There aren't any chairs. Суроо: Is there a bank near here? Are there any shops? Жообу: Yes, there is. / No, there aren't.","signal":["there is","there are","any","a lot of"],"examples":[{"en":"There is a book on the table.","ky":"Столдун үстүндө китеп бар."},{"en":"There are three chairs in the room.","ky":"Бөлмөдө үч отургуч бар."},{"en":"There isn't a park near my house.","ky":"Үйүмдүн жанында парк жок."},{"en":"Is there a bank here?","ky":"Бул жерде банк барбы?"},{"en":"There aren't any apples.","ky":"Алма жок."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"There is two cats.","right":"There are two cats.","why_ky":"Көптүк болгондо are колдонулат."},{"wrong":"There are a dog.","right":"There is a dog.","why_ky":"Бир нерсе болгондо is."},{"wrong":"Are there a shop?","right":"Is there a shop?","why_ky":"a shop - бирдик, ошондуктан Is there."}],"exercises":[{"q":"There ___ a pen on the desk.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"There ___ four chairs.","options":["is","are","be"],"answer":"are"},{"q":"There ___ some milk in the fridge.","options":["are","is","am"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"___ there a park near here?","options":["Are","Is","Do"],"answer":"Is"},{"q":"___ there any students?","options":["Is","Are","Does"],"answer":"Are"},{"q":"There ___ a bank here. (-)","options":["isn't","aren't","not"],"answer":"isn't"},{"q":"There ___ any books. (-)","options":["isn't","aren't","not is"],"answer":"aren't"},{"q":"There ___ a cat and two dogs.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"There ___ many people in the street.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":"are"},{"q":"Is there a school? - No, there ___.","options":["isn't","aren't","not"],"answer":"isn't"}],"speak":["Describe your room: There is... There are...","Ask: Is there a shop near your house?"]},{"id":"possessive-adjectives","title":"Possessive adjectives","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"Тиешелүүлүк сын атоочтору (my, your, his...)","when_ky":"Бир нерсе кимдики экенин көрсөтөт: менин, сенин, анын, биздин.","form":[["бирдик","my, your, his, her, its"],["көптүк","our, your, their"],["орду","possessive + зат атооч: my book"]],"rule_ky":"I - my, you - your, he - his, she - her, it - its, we - our, they - their. Алар зат атоочтун алдына коюлат жана зат атоочтун саны менен өзгөрбөйт: my book, my books. Эркек жөнүндө his, аял жөнүндө her колдонобуз: Tom - his bag, Anna - her bag.","signal":["my","your","his / her","our / their"],"examples":[{"en":"This is my bag.","ky":"Бул менин сумкам."},{"en":"Her name is Aigul.","ky":"Анын (аялдын) аты Айгүл."},{"en":"His brother is a doctor.","ky":"Анын (эркектин) агасы дарыгер."},{"en":"We love our school.","ky":"Биз мектебибизди жакшы көрөбүз."},{"en":"They are with their parents.","ky":"Алар ата-энеси менен."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"She loves his mother. (Anna's mother)","right":"She loves her mother.","why_ky":"Аял жөнүндө her колдонулат."},{"wrong":"I like me school.","right":"I like my school.","why_ky":"me эмес, my."},{"wrong":"Tom and Ben have she car.","right":"Tom and Ben have their car.","why_ky":"Көптүк үчүн their."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I have a dog. ___ dog is big.","options":["My","Me","I"],"answer":"My"},{"q":"She is Anna. ___ mother is a nurse.","options":["His","Her","Hers"],"answer":"Her"},{"q":"He is Tom. ___ sister is 10.","options":["His","Her","Him"],"answer":"His"},{"q":"We live in Osh. ___ house is small.","options":["Our","We","Us"],"answer":"Our"},{"q":"They love ___ teacher.","options":["there","their","them"],"answer":"their"},{"q":"You have ___ pen.","options":["you","your","yours"],"answer":"your"},{"q":"The cat likes ___ food.","options":["it","its","it's"],"answer":"its"},{"q":"My sister and I love ___ grandmother.","options":["our","my","their"],"answer":"our"},{"q":"Is this ___ bag? (to a friend)","options":["you","your","yours"],"answer":"your"},{"q":"Aigul and Nurlan like ___ school.","options":["their","her","his"],"answer":"their"}],"speak":["Introduce your family: This is my mother. Her name is...","Tell about your friend: His/Her name is..."]},{"id":"prepositions-place","title":"Prepositions of place","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"Орун предлогдору (in, on, under, next to)","when_ky":"Нерсе кайда экенин айтканда колдонобуз.","form":[["in","ичинде: in the box"],["on","үстүндө: on the table"],["under / next to","астында / жанында"]],"rule_ky":"in — ичинде: in the room. on — бетинде, үстүндө: on the desk. under — астында: under the chair. next to — дароо жанында: next to the door. behind — артында. in front of — алдында. between — экөөнүн ортосунда. Кайда? (Where?) деген суроого жооп берет: Where is the cat? It is under the table.","signal":["in","on","under","next to","behind","between"],"examples":[{"en":"The book is on the table.","ky":"Китеп столдун үстүндө."},{"en":"The cat is under the chair.","ky":"Мышык отургучтун астында."},{"en":"My keys are in the bag.","ky":"Ачкычтарым сумканын ичинде."},{"en":"The bank is next to the school.","ky":"Банк мектептин жанында."},{"en":"The ball is behind the door.","ky":"Топ эшиктин артында."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"The pen is in the table.","right":"The pen is on the table.","why_ky":"Үстүндө дегенде on колдонулат."},{"wrong":"She sits in front the window.","right":"She sits in front of the window.","why_ky":"in front of - толук форма."},{"wrong":"The dog is in under the bed.","right":"The dog is under the bed.","why_ky":"Эки предлогду катар коюуга болбойт."}],"exercises":[{"q":"The book is ___ the table. (top)","options":["in","on","under"],"answer":"on"},{"q":"The cat is ___ the box. (inside)","options":["on","in","next"],"answer":"in"},{"q":"The ball is ___ the chair. (below)","options":["on","under","at"],"answer":"under"},{"q":"The shop is ___ the bank. (beside)","options":["next to","in","under"],"answer":"next to"},{"q":"The garden is ___ the house. (at the back)","options":["behind","between","in"],"answer":"behind"},{"q":"The school is ___ the park and the bank.","options":["between","on","in"],"answer":"between"},{"q":"My pencil is ___ my bag. (inside)","options":["in","on","behind"],"answer":"in"},{"q":"The picture is ___ the wall.","options":["in","on","under"],"answer":"on"},{"q":"The car is ___ the house. (at the front)","options":["in front of","behind","in"],"answer":"in front of"},{"q":"The dog is sleeping ___ the bed. (below it)","options":["under","between","next"],"answer":"under"}],"speak":["Say where things are in your room.","Ask: Where is your phone? Answer using in/on/under."]},{"id":"imperatives","title":"Imperatives","level":"Pre-A1/A1","title_ky":"Буйрук ыңгай (imperatives)","when_ky":"Буйрук берүү, суранычтоо, эскертүү жана нускама берүү үчүн колдонулат: Open the door! Don't run!","form":[["+","V1: Sit down."],["-","Don't + V1: Don't talk."],["+please","Please open your book."]],"rule_ky":"Буйрук ыңгайда подлежащее жок, этиш V1 формасында башталат: Stand up. Тыюу салуу үчүн Don't + V1: Don't be late. Сылык болуш үчүн please кошобуз: Please sit down. Биргелешип кылууну сунуштоо үчүн Let's + V1: Let's play.","signal":["please","don't","let's"],"examples":[{"en":"Open your books.","ky":"Китептериңди ачкыла."},{"en":"Don't run in the corridor.","ky":"Коридордо чуркаба."},{"en":"Please sit down.","ky":"Отурсаңыз."},{"en":"Be quiet!","ky":"Тынч бол!"},{"en":"Let's go to the park.","ky":"Паркка барылы."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"Opens the door.","right":"Open the door.","why_ky":"Буйрукта этиш V1 формасында болот, -s кошулбайт."},{"wrong":"Not run!","right":"Don't run!","why_ky":"Тыюуда Don't колдонулат."},{"wrong":"You sit down!","right":"Sit down!","why_ky":"Буйрукта you айтылбайт."}],"exercises":[{"q":"___ your book. (open)","options":["Opens","Open","Opening"],"answer":"Open"},{"q":"___ talk in class!","options":["Not","Don't","No"],"answer":"Don't"},{"q":"___ late for school!","options":["Don't be","Not be","Don't"],"answer":"Don't be"},{"q":"Please ___ down.","options":["sits","sit","sitting"],"answer":"sit"},{"q":"___ play football!","options":["Let's","Lets","Let"],"answer":"Let's"},{"q":"___ the window, please. (close)","options":["Close","Closes","To close"],"answer":"Close"},{"q":"___ your homework.","options":["Does","Do","Doing"],"answer":"Do"},{"q":"___ noise! (don't make)","options":["Don't make","Not make","Doesn't make"],"answer":"Don't make"},{"q":"___ me your pen, please.","options":["Gives","Give","Giving"],"answer":"Give"},{"q":"___ quiet, please.","options":["Is","Be","Are"],"answer":"Be"}],"speak":["Give 3 orders to your classmate: Stand up! Open...","Say 3 school rules with Don't."]},{"id":"present-simple","title":"Present Simple","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Азыркы жөнөкөй чак","when_ky":"Адатта кайталанып турган иштерди, күнүмдүк жумуштарды жана өзгөрбөй турган чындыкты айтканда колдонобуз: Мен күн сайын мектепке барам. Жер Күндүн тегерегинде айланат.","form":[["+","I/You/We/They + V1; He/She/It + V-s"],["-","don't / doesn't + V1"],["?","Do / Does + subject + V1?"]],"rule_ky":"I, you, we, they менен этиш өзгөрбөйт: I play. He, she, it менен этишке -s же -es кошобуз: he plays, she watches, it goes. Терс: I don't play, he doesn't play. Суроо: Do you play? Does he play? Does/doesn't болгондо этиш -s албайт: Does she play? (plays эмес). Y менен бүтсө (үнсүз + y): study - studies.","signal":["every day","always","usually","often","never","on Mondays"],"examples":[{"en":"I get up at seven every day.","ky":"Мен күн сайын саат жетиде турам."},{"en":"She works in a hospital.","ky":"Ал ооруканада иштейт."},{"en":"We don't eat meat.","ky":"Биз эт жебейбиз."},{"en":"Does he speak English?","ky":"Ал англисче сүйлөйбү?"},{"en":"The sun rises in the east.","ky":"Күн чыгыштан чыгат."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"He go to school.","right":"He goes to school.","why_ky":"he/she/it менен этишке -s/-es кошулат."},{"wrong":"She doesn't likes tea.","right":"She doesn't like tea.","why_ky":"doesn't болгондо этиш V1 формасында болот."},{"wrong":"Do she work here?","right":"Does she work here?","why_ky":"she менен Does колдонулат."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ breakfast at 8.","options":["have","has","having"],"answer":"have"},{"q":"She ___ to school by bus.","options":["go","goes","going"],"answer":"goes"},{"q":"They ___ football on Sundays.","options":["plays","play","playing"],"answer":"play"},{"q":"He ___ like fish. (-)","options":["don't","doesn't","isn't"],"answer":"doesn't"},{"q":"___ you live in Bishkek?","options":["Does","Do","Are"],"answer":"Do"},{"q":"___ she speak English?","options":["Do","Does","Is"],"answer":"Does"},{"q":"My mother ___ in a shop.","options":["work","works","working"],"answer":"works"},{"q":"We ___ watch TV in the morning. (-)","options":["doesn't","don't","aren't"],"answer":"don't"},{"q":"The baby ___ a lot. (sleep)","options":["sleep","sleeps","sleeping"],"answer":"sleeps"},{"q":"Does he ___ tea?","options":["drinks","drink","drinking"],"answer":"drink"}],"speak":["Tell about your day: I get up at... I go to school at...","Ask your friend: Do you like...? What time do you...?"]},{"id":"present-continuous","title":"Present Continuous","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Азыркы улана турган чак","when_ky":"Азыр, айтып жаткан учурда болуп жаткан иштерди айтканда колдонобуз: Мен азыр китеп окуп жатам. Ошондой эле жакын убакыттагы пландар үчүн.","form":[["+","am / is / are + V-ing"],["-","am not / isn't / aren't + V-ing"],["?","Am / Is / Are + subject + V-ing?"]],"rule_ky":"to be (am/is/are) + этиш + -ing: I am reading, she is cooking, they are playing. -e менен бүтсө e түшөт: make - making. Кыска этиштин акыркы үнсүзү эки эселенет: run - running, sit - sitting. Суроо: Are you sleeping? Терс: He isn't working. Кээ бир этиштер (like, love, know, want) -ing формасында колдонулбайт.","signal":["now","at the moment","right now","Look!","Listen!"],"examples":[{"en":"I am reading a book now.","ky":"Мен азыр китеп окуп жатам."},{"en":"She is cooking dinner.","ky":"Ал кечки тамак бышырып жатат."},{"en":"They are playing in the park.","ky":"Алар паркта ойноп жатышат."},{"en":"Are you sleeping?","ky":"Сен уктап жатасыңбы?"},{"en":"It isn't raining now.","ky":"Азыр жамгыр жаап жаткан жок."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I reading now.","right":"I am reading now.","why_ky":"am/is/are кошуу керек."},{"wrong":"She is cook.","right":"She is cooking.","why_ky":"Этишке -ing кошулат."},{"wrong":"He is runing.","right":"He is running.","why_ky":"run - running, n эки эселенет."}],"exercises":[{"q":"Look! It ___ raining.","options":["is","are","does"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"I ___ English now.","options":["study","am studying","studies"],"answer":"am studying"},{"q":"They ___ football at the moment.","options":["is playing","are playing","plays"],"answer":"are playing"},{"q":"She ___ TV now. (-)","options":["isn't watching","doesn't watching","aren't watching"],"answer":"isn't watching"},{"q":"___ you listening to me?","options":["Do","Are","Is"],"answer":"Are"},{"q":"We ___ lunch right now.","options":["is having","are having","have"],"answer":"are having"},{"q":"He ___ a letter at the moment. (write)","options":["is writting","is writing","is write"],"answer":"is writing"},{"q":"The children ___ in the garden.","options":["is running","are running","are runing"],"answer":"are running"},{"q":"Listen! Someone ___.","options":["sings","is singing","are singing"],"answer":"is singing"},{"q":"What ___ you doing?","options":["is","are","do"],"answer":"are"}],"speak":["Look at the picture and tell: He is... She is...","Say what you are doing right now."]},{"id":"present-simple-vs-continuous","title":"Present Simple vs Present Continuous","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Present Simple менен Present Continuous айырмасы","when_ky":"Present Simple адат жана чындык үчүн, Present Continuous азыр болуп жаткан иш үчүн колдонулат.","form":[["Simple","every day, usually: I drink tea every day."],["Continuous","now, at the moment: I am drinking tea now."],["Stative","know, like, want: Simple гана колдонулат"]],"rule_ky":"Present Simple: кайталануучу иш, адат, чындык (I play football on Sundays). Present Continuous: азыр болуп жаткан иш (I am playing football now). Белгилери: always, usually, every day, never — Simple; now, at the moment, today, Look! — Continuous. Like, love, hate, know, want, need, understand сыяктуу этиштер адатта Continuous менен колдонулбайт: I know him (I am knowing эмес).","signal":["always / usually / every day","now / at the moment / Look!"],"examples":[{"en":"I usually walk to school, but today I am taking a bus.","ky":"Мен адатта мектепке жөө барам, бирок бүгүн автобус менен баратам."},{"en":"She speaks English, but now she is speaking Kyrgyz.","ky":"Ал англисче сүйлөйт, бирок азыр кыргызча сүйлөп жатат."},{"en":"He plays tennis on Fridays.","ky":"Ал жума күнү теннис ойнойт."},{"en":"They are watching a film now.","ky":"Алар азыр кино көрүп жатышат."},{"en":"I know the answer.","ky":"Мен жоопту билем."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I am going to school every day.","right":"I go to school every day.","why_ky":"every day - адат, ошондуктан Present Simple."},{"wrong":"She cooks now.","right":"She is cooking now.","why_ky":"now - азыркы учур, Present Continuous."},{"wrong":"I am knowing him.","right":"I know him.","why_ky":"know - Continuous менен колдонулбайт."}],"exercises":[{"q":"He ___ to work every day.","options":["goes","is going","go"],"answer":"goes"},{"q":"Look! The baby ___.","options":["sleeps","is sleeping","sleep"],"answer":"is sleeping"},{"q":"I ___ TV now.","options":["watch","am watching","watches"],"answer":"am watching"},{"q":"My mother ___ at a school. She is a teacher.","options":["works","is working","work"],"answer":"works"},{"q":"They ___ football on Sundays.","options":["are playing","play","plays"],"answer":"play"},{"q":"Be quiet! We ___ a test.","options":["write","are writing","writes"],"answer":"are writing"},{"q":"She usually ___ coffee.","options":["drinks","is drinking","drink"],"answer":"drinks"},{"q":"I ___ the answer.","options":["know","am knowing","knows"],"answer":"know"},{"q":"It ___ now. Take an umbrella.","options":["rains","is raining","rain"],"answer":"is raining"},{"q":"He ___ his teeth every morning.","options":["is brushing","brush","brushes"],"answer":"brushes"}],"speak":["Tell what you usually do and what you are doing today.","Compare: I usually... but today I..."]},{"id":"past-simple-regular","title":"Past Simple (regular verbs)","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Өткөн чак: жөнөкөй (туура этиштер)","when_ky":"Өткөндө болуп бүткөн иштерди айтканда колдонобуз. Качан болгону белгилүү: Мен кечээ футбол ойнодум.","form":[["+","subject + V-ed (played, worked)"],["-","didn't + V1"],["?","Did + subject + V1?"]],"rule_ky":"Туура этиштерге -ed кошобуз: play - played, work - worked. -e менен бүтсө -d гана: like - liked. Үнсүз + y болсо y ордуна -ied: study - studied. Кыска этиштин акыркы үнсүзү эки эселенет: stop - stopped. Терс жана суроодо did колдонулат, ал эми этиш V1 болот: I didn't play. Did you play?","signal":["yesterday","last week","ago","in 2020"],"examples":[{"en":"I played football yesterday.","ky":"Мен кечээ футбол ойнодум."},{"en":"She studied English last year.","ky":"Ал өткөн жылы англис тилин окуду."},{"en":"We watched a film last night.","ky":"Биз кечээ кечинде кино көрдүк."},{"en":"He didn't work on Monday.","ky":"Ал дүйшөмбүдө иштеген жок."},{"en":"Did you call me?","ky":"Сен мага чалдыңбы?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I playd football.","right":"I played football.","why_ky":"-ed кошулат: played."},{"wrong":"She didn't played.","right":"She didn't play.","why_ky":"didn't болгондо этиш V1 болот."},{"wrong":"Did he worked?","right":"Did he work?","why_ky":"Did менен этиш V1 болот."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ my homework yesterday.","options":["do","did","done"],"answer":"did"},{"q":"She ___ to music last night. (listen)","options":["listened","listen","listens"],"answer":"listened"},{"q":"We ___ football last Sunday. (play)","options":["played","plays","play"],"answer":"played"},{"q":"He ___ TV yesterday. (-)","options":["didn't watch","didn't watched","doesn't watch"],"answer":"didn't watch"},{"q":"___ you clean your room?","options":["Do","Did","Were"],"answer":"Did"},{"q":"They ___ in Bishkek in 2020. (live)","options":["lived","livd","live"],"answer":"lived"},{"q":"She ___ hard last year. (study)","options":["studyed","studied","studys"],"answer":"studied"},{"q":"The bus ___ at the station. (stop)","options":["stoped","stopped","stopd"],"answer":"stopped"},{"q":"I ___ him two days ago. (call)","options":["called","call","calling"],"answer":"called"},{"q":"Did she ___ the door?","options":["opened","open","opens"],"answer":"open"}],"speak":["Tell what you did yesterday: I cleaned... I watched...","Ask: Did you play/watch/help... yesterday?"]},{"id":"past-simple-irregular","title":"Past Simple (irregular verbs)","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Өткөн чак: туура эмес этиштер","when_ky":"Көп таралган этиштердин өткөн чагы -ed кошуп жасалбайт, өзүнчө форма болот. Алар жаттоону талап кылат: go - went, see - saw.","form":[["+","subject + V2 (went, saw, ate)"],["-","didn't + V1"],["?","Did + subject + V1?"]],"rule_ky":"Туура эмес этиштердин өткөн чак формасы (V2) өзүнчө жаттоону талап кылат. Терс жана суроодо туура этиштер сыяктуу did колдонулат жана этиш V1 болот: I didn't go. Did you see him? Төмөнкү 30 этишти жаттаңыз: be - was/were, have - had, do - did, go - went, come - came, see - saw, eat - ate, drink - drank, take - took, make - made, get - got, give - gave, buy - bought, write - wrote, read - read, say - said, tell - told, know - knew, think - thought, find - found, run - ran, sit - sat, stand - stood, sleep - slept, speak - spoke, meet - met, leave - left, bring - brought, begin - began, sing - sang.","signal":["yesterday","last week","ago","in 2019"],"examples":[{"en":"I went to the market yesterday.","ky":"Мен кечээ базарга бардым."},{"en":"She saw a big dog.","ky":"Ал чоң ит көрдү."},{"en":"We ate plov for dinner.","ky":"Биз кечки тамакка палоо жедик."},{"en":"He didn't buy a book.","ky":"Ал китеп сатып албады."},{"en":"Did you meet him last week?","ky":"Сен аны өткөн жумада жолуктурдуңбу?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I goed to school.","right":"I went to school.","why_ky":"go - туура эмес этиш: went."},{"wrong":"She didn't went home.","right":"She didn't go home.","why_ky":"didn't болгондо этиш V1 болот."},{"wrong":"He buyed a car.","right":"He bought a car.","why_ky":"buy - bought."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ to the shop yesterday.","options":["go","goed","went"],"answer":"went"},{"q":"She ___ a nice dress last week.","options":["buyed","bought","buy"],"answer":"bought"},{"q":"We ___ pizza last night.","options":["ate","eated","eat"],"answer":"ate"},{"q":"He ___ a letter yesterday.","options":["writed","wrote","write"],"answer":"wrote"},{"q":"They ___ me at the park.","options":["saw","seed","see"],"answer":"saw"},{"q":"I ___ a lot of water. (drink)","options":["drinked","drank","drunk"],"answer":"drank"},{"q":"Did you ___ the film?","options":["saw","see","seen"],"answer":"see"},{"q":"She ___ at home. (not, be)","options":["wasn't","weren't","didn't be"],"answer":"wasn't"},{"q":"He ___ the book on the table. (take)","options":["taked","took","take"],"answer":"took"},{"q":"We ___ to Issyk-Kul last summer.","options":["come","camed","came"],"answer":"came"}],"speak":["Tell what you did last weekend using went, saw, ate.","Ask: What did you eat yesterday? Where did you go?"]},{"id":"past-continuous","title":"Past Continuous","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Өткөн убакытта улана турган чак","when_ky":"Өткөндө белгилүү бир убакытта улантылып жаткан иш жөнүндө айтканда колдонобуз: Кечээ саат 5 те мен китеп окуп жаттым.","form":[["+","was / were + V-ing"],["-","wasn't / weren't + V-ing"],["?","Was / Were + subject + V-ing?"]],"rule_ky":"I, he, she, it менен was, you, we, they менен were колдонулат, ага -ing кошулат: I was reading, they were playing. Терс: She wasn't sleeping. Суроо: Were you working? Көбүнчө убакыт белгиси менен колдонулат: at 5 o'clock yesterday, at that moment, while.","signal":["at 5 o'clock yesterday","while","at that time"],"examples":[{"en":"I was reading at 8 o'clock.","ky":"Мен саат сегизде китеп окуп жаткам."},{"en":"She was cooking when I came.","ky":"Мен келгенде ал тамак жасап жаткан."},{"en":"They were playing in the garden.","ky":"Алар бакчада ойноп жатышкан."},{"en":"We weren't sleeping.","ky":"Биз уктап жаткан жокпуз."},{"en":"Was he working at that time?","ky":"Ал ошол убакта иштеп жаткандыбы?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I were reading.","right":"I was reading.","why_ky":"I менен was колдонулат."},{"wrong":"They was playing.","right":"They were playing.","why_ky":"They менен were."},{"wrong":"She was cook.","right":"She was cooking.","why_ky":"was/were менен этишке -ing кошулат."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ TV at 7 o'clock yesterday.","options":["watched","was watching","were watching"],"answer":"was watching"},{"q":"They ___ football at that time.","options":["was playing","were playing","played"],"answer":"were playing"},{"q":"She ___ when I called. (sleep)","options":["was sleeping","were sleeping","slept"],"answer":"was sleeping"},{"q":"We ___ at 9 o'clock. (-, study)","options":["weren't studying","wasn't studying","didn't studying"],"answer":"weren't studying"},{"q":"___ you working at 6 pm?","options":["Was","Were","Did"],"answer":"Were"},{"q":"He ___ a book at that moment.","options":["was reading","were reading","reads"],"answer":"was reading"},{"q":"It ___ all day yesterday. (rain)","options":["were raining","was raining","rains"],"answer":"was raining"},{"q":"The children ___ in the yard.","options":["was playing","were playing","are playing"],"answer":"were playing"},{"q":"When I came home, my mother ___ dinner.","options":["were cooking","was cooking","cooks"],"answer":"was cooking"},{"q":"___ he sleeping at 10?","options":["Were","Was","Did"],"answer":"Was"}],"speak":["Tell what you were doing at 8 pm yesterday.","Ask: What were you doing at 9 o'clock?"]},{"id":"past-simple-vs-continuous","title":"Past Simple vs Past Continuous","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Past Simple менен Past Continuous айырмасы","when_ky":"Бир иш уланып жатканда, экинчи кыска иш аны бөлүп койгонун айтканда колдонобуз: Мен тамак жасап жатканда телефон чалды.","form":[["Continuous","узак иш: I was cooking (while)"],["Simple","кыска иш: the phone rang (when)"],["сүйлөм","I was cooking when the phone rang."]],"rule_ky":"Узак иш (фон) үчүн Past Continuous, аны бөлгөн кыска иш үчүн Past Simple колдонулат. when кыска иштин алдына, while узак иштин алдына коюлат: While I was walking, I saw a dog. When I saw a dog, I was walking. Эки иш бир эле учурда уланса, экөө тең Continuous: I was reading while she was cooking.","signal":["when","while","suddenly"],"examples":[{"en":"I was sleeping when the phone rang.","ky":"Телефон чалганда мен уктап жаттым."},{"en":"While she was walking, she saw a snake.","ky":"Ал басып баратканда жыланды көрдү."},{"en":"They were playing when it started to rain.","ky":"Жамгыр жаай баштаганда алар ойноп жатышкан."},{"en":"He broke his leg while he was skiing.","ky":"Ал лыжа тебүүдө буту сынды."},{"en":"I was reading while my mother was cooking.","ky":"Апам тамак жасап жатканда мен китеп окуп жаттым."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"When I was seeing him, I said hello.","right":"When I saw him, I said hello.","why_ky":"Кыска иш (бир жолку) Past Simple менен."},{"wrong":"I watched TV when she called.","right":"I was watching TV when she called.","why_ky":"Узак иш Past Continuous менен."},{"wrong":"While I walked, I fell.","right":"While I was walking, I fell.","why_ky":"while менен узак иш Continuous."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ TV when you called.","options":["watched","was watching","watch"],"answer":"was watching"},{"q":"She ___ the book when he came in. (read)","options":["was reading","reads","were reading"],"answer":"was reading"},{"q":"While we ___, it started to rain. (walk)","options":["walked","were walking","was walking"],"answer":"were walking"},{"q":"He ___ his phone while he was running.","options":["dropped","was dropping","drops"],"answer":"dropped"},{"q":"They ___ when the teacher entered.","options":["talked","were talking","was talking"],"answer":"were talking"},{"q":"When I ___ home, my mother was cooking.","options":["arrived","was arriving","arrive"],"answer":"arrived"},{"q":"I ___ in the park when I saw an old friend.","options":["walked","was walking","walk"],"answer":"was walking"},{"q":"She ___ asleep while she was reading. (fall)","options":["fell","was falling","falls"],"answer":"fell"},{"q":"The phone ___ while I was taking a shower.","options":["was ringing","rang","rings"],"answer":"rang"},{"q":"What ___ you doing when I called?","options":["was","were","did"],"answer":"were"}],"speak":["Tell a story: I was ... when suddenly...","Say what you were doing when the lights went out."]},{"id":"going-to","title":"Future: going to","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Келечек чак: going to","when_ky":"Алдын ала пландаштырылган иштер жөнүндө, ошондой эле азыр көрүнүп турган белгилерге таянып божомолдоо үчүн колдонобуз.","form":[["+","am / is / are + going to + V1"],["-","am not / isn't / aren't + going to + V1"],["?","Am / Is / Are + subject + going to + V1?"]],"rule_ky":"am/is/are + going to + этиш (V1): I am going to visit my grandmother. Бул биз чечип койгон план: Мен чоң энеме барууну пландап жатам. Ошондой эле көрүнүп турган белги: Look at the clouds! It is going to rain. Терс: She isn't going to come. Суроо: Are you going to study tonight?","signal":["tomorrow","next week","tonight","soon","in two days"],"examples":[{"en":"I am going to visit my grandmother tomorrow.","ky":"Мен эртең чоң энеме барам (пландап жатам)."},{"en":"She is going to buy a new phone.","ky":"Ал жаңы телефон сатып алганы жатат."},{"en":"Look at the sky! It is going to rain.","ky":"Асманды карачы! Жамгыр жаайын деп турат."},{"en":"We aren't going to watch TV tonight.","ky":"Бүгүн кечинде биз телевизор көрбөйбүз."},{"en":"Are you going to study tonight?","ky":"Бүгүн кечинде сен окуйсуңбу?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I going to play.","right":"I am going to play.","why_ky":"am/is/are кошуу керек."},{"wrong":"She is going to goes.","right":"She is going to go.","why_ky":"going to дан кийин этиш V1."},{"wrong":"They going to come.","right":"They are going to come.","why_ky":"they менен are."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ going to visit my aunt.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":"am"},{"q":"She ___ going to buy a bike.","options":["is","am","are"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"They ___ going to play football tomorrow.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":"are"},{"q":"We are going to ___ a film.","options":["watching","watch","watches"],"answer":"watch"},{"q":"___ you going to study tonight?","options":["Is","Are","Do"],"answer":"Are"},{"q":"He ___ going to come. (-)","options":["aren't","isn't","doesn't"],"answer":"isn't"},{"q":"Look at those clouds! It ___ rain.","options":["is going to","are going to","goes to"],"answer":"is going to"},{"q":"I am going to ___ my homework after school.","options":["do","does","doing"],"answer":"do"},{"q":"What ___ she going to wear?","options":["is","are","does"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"My parents ___ going to travel next month.","options":["is","are","am"],"answer":"are"}],"speak":["Tell your plans for tomorrow: I am going to...","Ask: What are you going to do this weekend?"]},{"id":"will","title":"Future: will","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Келечек чак: will","when_ky":"Ошол заматта кабыл алынган чечим, ыйгарым, убада, сунуш жана келечекти божомолдоо үчүн колдонобуз.","form":[["+","subject + will + V1 ('ll)"],["-","will not (won't) + V1"],["?","Will + subject + V1?"]],"rule_ky":"will бардык жактар менен бирдей жана ага -s кошулбайт: I will help you. She will come. Кыска форма: I'll, she'll, we'll. Терс: won't. Колдонулушу: убада (I will call you), ошол замат чечим (It's cold. I'll close the window), божомол (It will be sunny tomorrow). Суроо: Will you help me?","signal":["tomorrow","next year","I think","probably","soon"],"examples":[{"en":"I will call you tomorrow.","ky":"Мен сага эртең чалам."},{"en":"It will be sunny on Sunday.","ky":"Жекшембиде күн ачык болот."},{"en":"I'll help you with your bag.","ky":"Мен сумкаң менен жардам берейин."},{"en":"She won't come to the party.","ky":"Ал кечеге келбейт."},{"en":"Will you open the door, please?","ky":"Эшикти ачып бересизби?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"She wills come.","right":"She will come.","why_ky":"will менен -s кошулбайт."},{"wrong":"I will to go.","right":"I will go.","why_ky":"will дан кийин to колдонулбайт."},{"wrong":"He will goes.","right":"He will go.","why_ky":"will дан кийин этиш V1."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I think it ___ rain tomorrow.","options":["will","wills","is will"],"answer":"will"},{"q":"She ___ help you.","options":["will","wills","will to"],"answer":"will"},{"q":"We ___ be late. (-)","options":["will not","won't","don't"],"answer":"won't"},{"q":"___ you call me tomorrow?","options":["Do","Will","Are"],"answer":"Will"},{"q":"I will ___ you tomorrow.","options":["to call","calls","call"],"answer":"call"},{"q":"The phone is ringing. - I ___ answer it!","options":["will","am going","do"],"answer":"will"},{"q":"It's cold. I ___ close the window.","options":["'ll","'m","do"],"answer":"'ll"},{"q":"He ___ be 18 next year.","options":["will","is will","wills"],"answer":"will"},{"q":"They ___ come to the party. (-)","options":["won't","don't","aren't"],"answer":"won't"},{"q":"Don't worry. Everything ___ be OK.","options":["will","wills","is"],"answer":"will"}],"speak":["Make 3 predictions about the future: In 2050 people will...","Promise something: I will help you with..."]},{"id":"comparatives-superlatives","title":"Comparatives and superlatives","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Салыштыруу жана үстөмдүк даража","when_ky":"Эки нерсени салыштырганда comparative (чоңураак), үчтөн көп нерсенин ичинен эң... дегенде superlative колдонобуз.","form":[["comparative","adj + -er / more + adj + than"],["superlative","the + adj + -est / the most + adj"],["туура эмес","good - better - best; bad - worse - worst"]],"rule_ky":"Кыска сөздөр (1 муун): tall - taller - the tallest. -e менен бүтсө: nice - nicer - the nicest. Үнсүз + y: easy - easier - the easiest. Узун сөздөр (2+ муун): beautiful - more beautiful - the most beautiful. Эки нерсени салыштырууда than колдонулат: He is taller than me. Туура эмес: good - better - best, bad - worse - worst, far - farther - farthest.","signal":["than","the + -est","the most"],"examples":[{"en":"My brother is taller than me.","ky":"Менин агам менден бою узун."},{"en":"This book is more interesting than that one.","ky":"Бул китеп тигинен кызыктуураак."},{"en":"Mount Everest is the highest mountain in the world.","ky":"Эверест дүйнөдөгү эң бийик тоо."},{"en":"Today is better than yesterday.","ky":"Бүгүн кечээгиден жакшы."},{"en":"She is the most beautiful girl in our class.","ky":"Ал биздин класстагы эң кооз кыз."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"more tall","right":"taller","why_ky":"Кыска сын атоочко -er кошулат."},{"wrong":"the most good","right":"the best","why_ky":"good - туура эмес: better - best."},{"wrong":"He is taller that me.","right":"He is taller than me.","why_ky":"Салыштырууда than колдонулат."}],"exercises":[{"q":"A car is ___ than a bike. (fast)","options":["faster","more fast","fastest"],"answer":"faster"},{"q":"This is ___ book in the shop. (cheap)","options":["cheaper","the cheapest","the most cheap"],"answer":"the cheapest"},{"q":"English is ___ than math for me. (easy)","options":["easier","more easy","easiest"],"answer":"easier"},{"q":"She is ___ girl in our class. (beautiful)","options":["more beautiful","the most beautiful","the beautifulest"],"answer":"the most beautiful"},{"q":"Today is ___ than yesterday. (good)","options":["gooder","better","best"],"answer":"better"},{"q":"My bag is ___ than yours. (heavy)","options":["heavier","more heavy","heaviest"],"answer":"heavier"},{"q":"Which is ___ animal in the world? (big)","options":["bigger","the biggest","the most big"],"answer":"the biggest"},{"q":"This film is ___ than that one. (interesting)","options":["more interesting","interestinger","the most interesting"],"answer":"more interesting"},{"q":"He is ___ student in the school. (bad)","options":["worse","the worst","the baddest"],"answer":"the worst"},{"q":"Bishkek is ___ than Osh. (big)","options":["bigger","biggest","more big"],"answer":"bigger"}],"speak":["Compare yourself with your friend: I am taller/younger than...","Say: The best film/food/place is..."]},{"id":"countable-uncountable","title":"Countable / uncountable + some/any, much/many","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Санала турган жана санап болбой турган зат атоочтор","when_ky":"Кээ бир нерселерди санаса болот (apple - apples), кээ бирлерин санаса болбойт (water, milk, money). Алар үчүн ар кандай сөздөр колдонулат.","form":[["countable","a/an, many, a few: many apples"],["uncountable","much, a little: much water"],["some / any","some (+), any (-, ?)"]],"rule_ky":"Санала турган: a book, two books. Санап болбой турган: water, milk, bread, money, rice, information. Көптүк санда болбойт. Many — санала турган көптүк менен (many books), much — санап болбой турган менен (much water), көбүнчө суроодо жана терс сүйлөмдө: How much money? How many apples? Some — бекитүүдө: I have some milk. Any — терс жана суроодо: I don't have any milk. Do you have any milk? Сунуштоодо some колдонулат: Would you like some tea?","signal":["some","any","much","many","a lot of"],"examples":[{"en":"I have some apples.","ky":"Менде бир нече алма бар."},{"en":"We don't have any milk.","ky":"Бизде сүт жок."},{"en":"How many books do you have?","ky":"Сенде канча китеп бар?"},{"en":"How much water do you drink?","ky":"Сен канча суу ичесиң?"},{"en":"Would you like some tea?","ky":"Чай ичесизби?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"How many water?","right":"How much water?","why_ky":"water - санап болбойт, much колдонулат."},{"wrong":"I don't have some money.","right":"I don't have any money.","why_ky":"Терс сүйлөмдө any."},{"wrong":"two breads","right":"two pieces of bread","why_ky":"bread - санап болбойт."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I have ___ apples.","options":["some","any","much"],"answer":"some"},{"q":"There isn't ___ milk.","options":["some","any","many"],"answer":"any"},{"q":"How ___ eggs do you need?","options":["much","many","some"],"answer":"many"},{"q":"How ___ sugar do you want?","options":["many","much","a few"],"answer":"much"},{"q":"Do you have ___ brothers?","options":["some","any","much"],"answer":"any"},{"q":"She doesn't have ___ money.","options":["many","much","a few"],"answer":"much"},{"q":"There are ___ students in the class.","options":["much","many","a little"],"answer":"many"},{"q":"Would you like ___ juice?","options":["some","any","many"],"answer":"some"},{"q":"I don't have ___ friends here.","options":["many","much","a little"],"answer":"many"},{"q":"Which word is uncountable?","options":["apple","water","book"],"answer":"water"}],"speak":["Say what is in your fridge: There is some... There aren't any...","Ask your friend: How many/much... do you...?"]},{"id":"question-words","title":"Question words","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Суроо сөздөрү","when_ky":"Кандайдыр бир маалымат сурап билгибиз келгенде суроо сөздөрүн колдонобуз.","form":[["сөз","what, where, when, who, why, how"],["түзүлүшү","question word + do/does/did + subject + V1?"],["to be менен","question word + am/is/are + subject?"]],"rule_ky":"What — эмне, who — ким, where — кайда, when — качан, why — эмнеге, how — кандай, which — кайсы, whose — кимдики, how many/much — канча, how old — канча жашта. Суроо сөзү сүйлөмдүн башында турат, андан кийин жардамчы этиш: Where do you live? Why is she crying? Who менен суроодо этиш өзгөрбөйт: Who lives here? Жообу: Because... — эмнеге деген суроого.","signal":["what","who","where","when","why","how"],"examples":[{"en":"What is your name?","ky":"Сенин атың ким?"},{"en":"Where do you live?","ky":"Сен кайда жашайсың?"},{"en":"When does the lesson start?","ky":"Сабак качан башталат?"},{"en":"Why are you sad?","ky":"Эмнеге капа болуп жатасың?"},{"en":"How old is your brother?","ky":"Агаң (иниң) канча жашта?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"Where you live?","right":"Where do you live?","why_ky":"do жардамчы этиши керек."},{"wrong":"What time does he comes?","right":"What time does he come?","why_ky":"does болгондо этиш V1."},{"wrong":"How many water?","right":"How much water?","why_ky":"water - санап болбойт."}],"exercises":[{"q":"___ is your name?","options":["What","Where","Who"],"answer":"What"},{"q":"___ do you live? - In Osh.","options":["When","Where","Who"],"answer":"Where"},{"q":"___ is that man? - He is my uncle.","options":["What","Who","When"],"answer":"Who"},{"q":"___ do you get up? - At 7.","options":["Where","When","Why"],"answer":"When"},{"q":"___ are you crying? - Because I'm sad.","options":["How","Why","Who"],"answer":"Why"},{"q":"___ old are you?","options":["What","How","Which"],"answer":"How"},{"q":"___ does he work?","options":["Where","Who","What"],"answer":"Where"},{"q":"___ is your birthday? - In May.","options":["When","Who","How"],"answer":"When"},{"q":"___ books do you have? - Five.","options":["How much","How many","What"],"answer":"How many"},{"q":"___ bag is this? - It's mine.","options":["Who","Whose","What"],"answer":"Whose"}],"speak":["Ask your friend 5 questions with what, where, when, who, why.","Interview your teacher: How old...? Where...?"]},{"id":"adverbs-frequency","title":"Adverbs of frequency","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Жыштык үстөк сөздөр (always, usually, never...)","when_ky":"Бир иш канчалык көп кайталанаарын айтканда колдонобуз: ар дайым, көбүнчө, кээде, эч качан.","form":[["100%","always"],["~80% / 60% / 30%","usually / often / sometimes"],["0%","never"]],"rule_ky":"always (ар дайым), usually (адатта), often (көп учурда), sometimes (кээде), rarely (сейрек), never (эч качан). Алар көбүнчө негизги этиштин алдына коюлат: I always get up early. Бирок to be этишинен кийин турат: She is never late. never менен терс форма колдонулбайт: I never eat fish (I don't never эмес). Суроо: How often do you...?","signal":["always","usually","often","sometimes","never"],"examples":[{"en":"I always brush my teeth.","ky":"Мен ар дайым тишимди тазалайм."},{"en":"She is usually at home on Sundays.","ky":"Ал жекшемби күнү адатта үйдө болот."},{"en":"We sometimes go to the cinema.","ky":"Биз кээде киного барабыз."},{"en":"He never eats fish.","ky":"Ал эч качан балык жебейт."},{"en":"How often do you read books?","ky":"Сен китепти канчалык көп окуйсуң?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I go always to school.","right":"I always go to school.","why_ky":"Жыштык сөз негизги этиштин алдында турат."},{"wrong":"She never is late.","right":"She is never late.","why_ky":"to be этишинен кийин турат."},{"wrong":"I don't never eat meat.","right":"I never eat meat.","why_ky":"never өзү терс, кошумча don't керек эмес."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ get up at 7. (every day)","options":["always","never","sometimes"],"answer":"always"},{"q":"He ___ eats fish. He doesn't like it.","options":["always","never","usually"],"answer":"never"},{"q":"She is ___ late. (0% of the time)","options":["never","always","often"],"answer":"never"},{"q":"They ___ play football on Sundays. (about 50%)","options":["sometimes","never","always"],"answer":"sometimes"},{"q":"I ___ drink tea in the morning. (almost every day)","options":["usually","never","rarely"],"answer":"usually"},{"q":"She ___ goes to the cinema. (once a year)","options":["rarely","always","usually"],"answer":"rarely"},{"q":"How ___ do you read books?","options":["often","many","much"],"answer":"often"},{"q":"I ___ go to the park on Saturdays. (every Saturday)","options":["always","never","rarely"],"answer":"always"},{"q":"We ___ go to school on Sunday.","options":["never","do never","don't never"],"answer":"never"},{"q":"He ___ helps his mother. (every time)","options":["always","never","hardly"],"answer":"always"}],"speak":["Tell about your habits: I always... I never...","Ask: How often do you play/read/walk?"]},{"id":"object-pronouns","title":"Object pronouns","level":"A1/A2","title_ky":"Толуктоочтук ат атоочтор (me, you, him...)","when_ky":"Этиштен же предлогдон кийин, иш-аракет кимге же эмнеге багытталганын көрсөтөт: Ал мени көрдү. Мага ката.","form":[["бирдик","me, you, him, her, it"],["көптүк","us, you, them"],["орду","verb / preposition + object pronoun"]],"rule_ky":"Подлежащее: I, you, he, she, it, we, they. Толуктооч: me, you, him, her, it, us, them. Подлежащее этиштин алдында, толуктооч этиштин же предлогдун кийининде турат: She loves me. Look at them. Give it to him. I know him, but he doesn't know me.","signal":["me","you","him","her","it","us","them"],"examples":[{"en":"She loves me.","ky":"Ал мени жакшы көрөт."},{"en":"I know him.","ky":"Мен аны билем."},{"en":"Please help us.","ky":"Бизге жардам бергиле."},{"en":"Give the book to her.","ky":"Китепти ага бер."},{"en":"Look at them!","ky":"Аларга кара!"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"She loves I.","right":"She loves me.","why_ky":"Этиштен кийин me колдонулат."},{"wrong":"Give he the book.","right":"Give him the book.","why_ky":"He - подлежащее, этиштен кийин him."},{"wrong":"I like they.","right":"I like them.","why_ky":"Толуктоочто them."}],"exercises":[{"q":"This is Tom. I know ___.","options":["he","him","his"],"answer":"him"},{"q":"Anna is my friend. I like ___.","options":["she","her","hers"],"answer":"her"},{"q":"Look at ___! (the birds)","options":["they","them","their"],"answer":"them"},{"q":"Can you help ___? (I need help)","options":["I","me","my"],"answer":"me"},{"q":"We are here. Please call ___.","options":["we","us","our"],"answer":"us"},{"q":"I have a dog. I love ___.","options":["it","its","he"],"answer":"it"},{"q":"She is talking to ___. (to you)","options":["you","your","yours"],"answer":"you"},{"q":"Tom is sad. Help ___.","options":["he","him","his"],"answer":"him"},{"q":"Where are the keys? I can't find ___.","options":["it","them","him"],"answer":"them"},{"q":"Give ___ the pen. (to her)","options":["she","her","hers"],"answer":"her"}],"speak":["Tell about your friend: I like him/her because...","Say: My teacher helps me/us..."]},{"id":"present-perfect","title":"Present Perfect","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Азыркы бүткөн чак (Present Perfect)","when_ky":"Өткөндө болгон, бирок азыркы учурга байланышы бар иштерди айтканда колдонобуз: тажрыйба (мен Лондондо болгом), жаңы эле бүткөн иш, же азыркыга чейин уланган убакыт.","form":[["+","have / has + V3 (past participle)"],["-","haven't / hasn't + V3"],["?","Have / Has + subject + V3?"]],"rule_ky":"have/has + V3. I, you, we, they менен have, he, she, it менен has. V3 туура этиштерде V-ed (played), туура эмеслерде өзүнчө форма (been, gone, seen, eaten, done). Качан болгону так айтылбайт. Белгилери: ever, never, already, yet, just, since, for. Since — башталган учур (since 2020), for — узактык (for two years). Суроо: Have you ever been to Paris?","signal":["ever","never","already","yet","just","since","for"],"examples":[{"en":"I have visited London.","ky":"Мен Лондондо болгом."},{"en":"She has just finished her homework.","ky":"Ал үй тапшырмасын жаңы эле бүтүрдү."},{"en":"Have you ever eaten sushi?","ky":"Сен сүшү жеп көрдүңбү?"},{"en":"We haven't seen that film yet.","ky":"Биз ал тасманы азырынча көргөн жокпуз."},{"en":"He has lived here for ten years.","ky":"Ал бул жерде он жылдан бери жашайт."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I have went to Paris.","right":"I have been to Paris.","why_ky":"go нун V3 формасы gone/been."},{"wrong":"She has visit London.","right":"She has visited London.","why_ky":"have/has дан кийин V3 керек."},{"wrong":"I have lived here since five years.","right":"I have lived here for five years.","why_ky":"Узактыкка for, башталган учурга since колдонулат."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ never ___ sushi.","options":["have / eaten","has / eaten","have / ate"],"answer":"have / eaten"},{"q":"She ___ just ___ home.","options":["have / arrived","has / arrived","has / arrive"],"answer":"has / arrived"},{"q":"___ you ever ___ to Paris?","options":["Have / been","Did / been","Has / been"],"answer":"Have / been"},{"q":"We ___ our homework yet. (-, do)","options":["haven't done","hasn't done","didn't done"],"answer":"haven't done"},{"q":"He ___ here for five years. (live)","options":["lives","has lived","have lived"],"answer":"has lived"},{"q":"They have lived here ___ 2015.","options":["for","since","ago"],"answer":"since"},{"q":"I have known her ___ ten years.","options":["since","for","from"],"answer":"for"},{"q":"She has ___ her keys. (lose)","options":["lose","lost","losed"],"answer":"lost"},{"q":"Have you ___ the news? (see)","options":["saw","seen","see"],"answer":"seen"},{"q":"My brother ___ already ___ lunch.","options":["have / eaten","has / eaten","has / ate"],"answer":"has / eaten"}],"speak":["Tell me three things you have done in your life.","Ask: Have you ever been to...? Have you ever eaten...?"]},{"id":"present-perfect-vs-past-simple","title":"Present Perfect vs Past Simple","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Present Perfect менен Past Simple айырмасы","when_ky":"Качан болгону так айтылса Past Simple, так убакыт жок же азыркыга байланышы бар болсо Present Perfect колдонулат.","form":[["Past Simple","так убакыт: I saw him yesterday."],["Present Perfect","убакыт айтылбайт: I have seen him."],["белги","ago, yesterday, in 2019 - Past Simple"]],"rule_ky":"Past Simple: аяктаган, так убакыт менен: yesterday, last year, ago, in 2020, when? деген суроо. Present Perfect: убакыт белгисиз, натыйжасы азыр маанилүү: ever, never, just, already, yet, for, since. Мисал: I lost my keys (кечээ) – Past Simple. I have lost my keys (азыр жок). Present Perfect менен yesterday, last week, ago колдонулбайт!","signal":["yesterday / ago / last week (PS)","ever / just / already / yet / since / for (PP)"],"examples":[{"en":"I saw him yesterday.","ky":"Мен аны кечээ көрдүм."},{"en":"I have seen him before.","ky":"Мен аны мурун көргөм."},{"en":"She went to Paris in 2019.","ky":"Ал 2019-жылы Парижге барган."},{"en":"She has been to Paris twice.","ky":"Ал Парижде эки жолу болгон."},{"en":"When did you buy it? - I bought it last week.","ky":"Аны качан сатып алдың? - Өткөн жумада."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I have seen him yesterday.","right":"I saw him yesterday.","why_ky":"yesterday менен Past Simple."},{"wrong":"Did you ever see this film?","right":"Have you ever seen this film?","why_ky":"ever менен Present Perfect."},{"wrong":"I live here since 2010.","right":"I have lived here since 2010.","why_ky":"since менен Present Perfect."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I ___ him yesterday.","options":["saw","have seen","has seen"],"answer":"saw"},{"q":"___ you ever ___ to London?","options":["Did / go","Have / been","Have / went"],"answer":"Have / been"},{"q":"She ___ in Bishkek in 2018.","options":["lived","has lived","have lived"],"answer":"lived"},{"q":"We ___ already ___ lunch.","options":["have / had","did / have","has / had"],"answer":"have / had"},{"q":"He ___ his bag two days ago.","options":["lost","has lost","have lost"],"answer":"lost"},{"q":"I ___ my homework yet. (-)","options":["didn't finish","haven't finished","hasn't finished"],"answer":"haven't finished"},{"q":"When ___ you ___ this phone?","options":["did / buy","have / bought","have / buy"],"answer":"did / buy"},{"q":"They ___ here for five years.","options":["lived","have lived","live"],"answer":"have lived"},{"q":"She ___ the film last night.","options":["saw","has seen","have seen"],"answer":"saw"},{"q":"I ___ never ___ snow.","options":["did / see","have / seen","have / saw"],"answer":"have / seen"}],"speak":["Compare: Last year I visited... I have visited...","Ask: What have you done today? What did you do yesterday?"]},{"id":"modal-verbs","title":"Modal verbs: must, have to, should","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Модалдык этиштер: must, have to, should","when_ky":"Милдеттенүү, зарылдык жана кеңеш берүү үчүн колдонулат. must жана have to — керек, should — жакшы болмок.","form":[["must","must + V1 (милдет)"],["have to","have/has to + V1 (сырткы мажбурлоо)"],["should","should + V1 (кеңеш)"]],"rule_ky":"Must — ички милдет же катуу эреже: You must stop at a red light. Have to — тышкы мажбурлоо: I have to wear a uniform. He/she/it менен has to. Терс түрлөрү: mustn't — болбойт (тыюу), don't have to — милдет эмес (кааласаң). Should — кеңеш: You should sleep more. Терс: shouldn't. must, should менен to жана -s колдонулбайт.","signal":["must","have to","should","mustn't","don't have to"],"examples":[{"en":"You must stop at a red light.","ky":"Кызыл жарыкта токтошуң керек."},{"en":"I have to wear a uniform at school.","ky":"Мен мектепте формада жүрүшүм керек."},{"en":"You should drink more water.","ky":"Сен көбүрөөк суу ичишиң керек (кеңеш)."},{"en":"You mustn't smoke here.","ky":"Бул жерде тамеки чегүүгө болбойт."},{"en":"She doesn't have to work on Sunday.","ky":"Ал жекшембиде иштеши шарт эмес."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"He musts go.","right":"He must go.","why_ky":"must менен -s кошулбайт."},{"wrong":"She should to study.","right":"She should study.","why_ky":"should дан кийин to жок."},{"wrong":"He have to go.","right":"He has to go.","why_ky":"he менен has to."}],"exercises":[{"q":"You ___ stop at a red light. (rule)","options":["must","should to","has to"],"answer":"must"},{"q":"She ___ wear a uniform at school. (rule)","options":["have to","has to","must to"],"answer":"has to"},{"q":"You look tired. You ___ go to bed.","options":["should","must to","have"],"answer":"should"},{"q":"You ___ smoke here. It's forbidden.","options":["mustn't","don't have to","shouldn't to"],"answer":"mustn't"},{"q":"It's Sunday. I ___ get up early. (not necessary)","options":["don't have to","mustn't","shouldn't to"],"answer":"don't have to"},{"q":"He ___ eat so much sugar. It is bad for him.","options":["shouldn't","don't have to","mustn't to"],"answer":"shouldn't"},{"q":"I ___ do my homework now.","options":["have to","has to","must to"],"answer":"have to"},{"q":"___ I wear a hat? - Yes, you should.","options":["Should","Must to","Has"],"answer":"Should"},{"q":"We ___ be quiet in the library.","options":["must","musts","have"],"answer":"must"},{"q":"My brother ___ work on Saturdays.","options":["have to","has to","musts"],"answer":"has to"}],"speak":["Give advice to a friend: You should...","Tell school rules: We must... We mustn't..."]},{"id":"first-conditional","title":"First conditional","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Биринчи шарттуу сүйлөм (first conditional)","when_ky":"Келечекте болушу мүмкүн болгон реалдуу шарт жана анын натыйжасы жөнүндө айтканда колдонобуз: Эгер жамгыр жааса, үйдө калабыз.","form":[["түзүлүшү","If + Present Simple, will + V1"],["терс","If + Present Simple, won't + V1"],["тескери","will + V1 + if + Present Simple"]],"rule_ky":"If бөлүгүндө Present Simple (келечек мааниде), негизги бөлүктө will + V1: If it rains, we will stay at home. If бөлүгүндө will колдонулбайт! (If it will rain - ката). Если if бөлүгү биринчи турса, үтүр коюлат. Бөлүктөрдү алмаштырууга болот: We will stay at home if it rains (үтүрсүз).","signal":["if","unless","when"],"examples":[{"en":"If it rains, we will stay at home.","ky":"Жамгыр жаайса, үйдө калабыз."},{"en":"If you study, you will pass the exam.","ky":"Окусаң, экзаменден өтөсүң."},{"en":"She will be late if she doesn't hurry.","ky":"Шашпаса, ал кечигет."},{"en":"If I see him, I will tell him.","ky":"Аны көрсөм, айтам."},{"en":"What will you do if you miss the bus?","ky":"Автобуска кечигип калсаң, эмне кыласың?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"If it will rain, we stay home.","right":"If it rains, we will stay home.","why_ky":"If бөлүгүндө will колдонулбайт."},{"wrong":"If I will see him, I tell him.","right":"If I see him, I will tell him.","why_ky":"If - Present Simple, экинчи бөлүк will менен."},{"wrong":"If you study, you pass.","right":"If you study, you will pass.","why_ky":"Келечектеги натыйжага will керек."}],"exercises":[{"q":"If it rains, we ___ at home.","options":["will stay","stay","stayed"],"answer":"will stay"},{"q":"If you ___ hard, you will pass.","options":["study","will study","studied"],"answer":"study"},{"q":"If she ___ late, I will be angry.","options":["will be","is","was"],"answer":"is"},{"q":"I ___ you if you need help.","options":["help","will help","helped"],"answer":"will help"},{"q":"If he ___ the bus, he will be late.","options":["misses","will miss","missed"],"answer":"misses"},{"q":"If we ___ now, we will arrive on time.","options":["leave","will leave","left"],"answer":"leave"},{"q":"They ___ the match if they play well.","options":["win","will win","won"],"answer":"will win"},{"q":"If it ___ tomorrow, we will go out.","options":["won't rain","doesn't rain","didn't rain"],"answer":"doesn't rain"},{"q":"She will be happy if you ___ her.","options":["call","will call","called"],"answer":"call"},{"q":"What will you do if you ___ the exam?","options":["fail","will fail","failed"],"answer":"fail"}],"speak":["Finish: If it rains tomorrow, I will...","Ask a friend: What will you do if you have free time?"]},{"id":"second-conditional","title":"Second conditional","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Экинчи шарттуу сүйлөм (second conditional)","when_ky":"Азыр же келечекте иш жүзүнө ашышы кыйын, ойдон чыгарылган кырдаал жөнүндө айтканда колдонобуз: Эгер мен миллионер болсом...","form":[["түзүлүшү","If + Past Simple, would + V1"],["терс","If + Past Simple, wouldn't + V1"],["were","If I were you, I would..."]],"rule_ky":"If бөлүгүндө Past Simple, негизги бөлүктө would + V1: If I had a million dollars, I would buy a big house. Өткөн чак бул жерде өткөндү эмес, реалдуу эместикти билдирет. be этиши үчүн бардык жактарда were колдонулат: If I were you, I would study more. Кеңеш берүүдө көп колдонулат.","signal":["if","would","If I were you"],"examples":[{"en":"If I had a million, I would buy a house.","ky":"Миллионум болсо, үй сатып алмакмын."},{"en":"If I were you, I would study more.","ky":"Мен сен болсом, көбүрөөк окумакмын."},{"en":"She would travel if she had time.","ky":"Убактысы болсо, ал саякаттамак."},{"en":"If he knew the answer, he would tell us.","ky":"Жоопту билсе, бизге айтмак."},{"en":"What would you do if you won the lottery?","ky":"Лотереядан утуп алсаң, эмне кылмаксың?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"If I would have money, I would buy it.","right":"If I had money, I would buy it.","why_ky":"If бөлүгүндө would колдонулбайт."},{"wrong":"If I am you, I would go.","right":"If I were you, I would go.","why_ky":"Реалдуу эмес кырдаалда were."},{"wrong":"If she knows, she would tell.","right":"If she knew, she would tell.","why_ky":"If бөлүгүндө Past Simple керек."}],"exercises":[{"q":"If I ___ rich, I would travel the world.","options":["am","were","will be"],"answer":"were"},{"q":"If she ___ more time, she would learn French.","options":["has","had","would have"],"answer":"had"},{"q":"I ___ a bigger house if I had more money.","options":["will buy","would buy","bought"],"answer":"would buy"},{"q":"If I ___ you, I would call him.","options":["am","was","were"],"answer":"were"},{"q":"What ___ you do if you saw a ghost?","options":["will","would","did"],"answer":"would"},{"q":"If he ___ harder, he would pass.","options":["studied","studies","will study"],"answer":"studied"},{"q":"They ___ happy if they won.","options":["will be","would be","are"],"answer":"would be"},{"q":"If it ___ warmer, we would go to the lake.","options":["were","is","will be"],"answer":"were"},{"q":"She wouldn't say that if she ___ the truth.","options":["knows","knew","will know"],"answer":"knew"},{"q":"If I ___ a bird, I would fly to the mountains.","options":["am","were","will be"],"answer":"were"}],"speak":["Finish: If I were a teacher, I would...","Say what you would do if you won a million dollars."]},{"id":"passive-voice","title":"Passive voice (present & past)","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Страдательный залог (Passive Voice)","when_ky":"Иш кимдин жасаганы маанилүү болбогондо, же ал белгисиз болгондо, же иштин натыйжасы маанилүү болгондо колдонобуз: Бул китеп 2010-жылы жазылган.","form":[["Present","am / is / are + V3"],["Past","was / were + V3"],["?","Is the book written...? / Was it built...?"]],"rule_ky":"Объект подлежащее болот: Active: Tom wrote this book. Passive: This book was written by Tom. Present Passive: is/are + V3: English is spoken in many countries. Past Passive: was/were + V3: The Eiffel Tower was built in 1889. Ким жасаганын көрсөтүү керек болсо by колдонулат: by Tom. Көпчүлүк учурда by керек эмес. Терс жана суроо: The window wasn't broken. Was the window broken?","signal":["by","in 1990","every day"],"examples":[{"en":"English is spoken all over the world.","ky":"Англис тили бүткүл дүйнөдө сүйлөнөт."},{"en":"This house was built in 1990.","ky":"Бул үй 1990-жылы курулган."},{"en":"The cars are made in Japan.","ky":"Машиналар Японияда жасалат."},{"en":"The window was broken yesterday.","ky":"Терезе кечээ сынган."},{"en":"Was the letter written by Anna?","ky":"Кат Анна тарабынан жазылганбы?"}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"The house built in 1990.","right":"The house was built in 1990.","why_ky":"was/were кошуу керек."},{"wrong":"The letter was wrote.","right":"The letter was written.","why_ky":"Passive де V3 колдонулат: written."},{"wrong":"English speaks here.","right":"English is spoken here.","why_ky":"Passive: is + V3."}],"exercises":[{"q":"English ___ in many countries.","options":["speaks","is spoken","was spoken"],"answer":"is spoken"},{"q":"This bridge ___ in 1950.","options":["built","was built","is built"],"answer":"was built"},{"q":"The rooms ___ every day. (clean)","options":["clean","are cleaned","were cleaned"],"answer":"are cleaned"},{"q":"The window ___ yesterday. (break)","options":["was broken","is broken","broke"],"answer":"was broken"},{"q":"These cars ___ in Germany.","options":["is made","are made","was made"],"answer":"are made"},{"q":"The letter ___ by my mother last week. (write)","options":["was written","is written","wrote"],"answer":"was written"},{"q":"___ the book written by Tolstoy?","options":["Was","Were","Did"],"answer":"Was"},{"q":"The pictures ___ by a famous artist. (paint, past)","options":["was painted","were painted","are painted"],"answer":"were painted"},{"q":"Milk ___ in the fridge. (keep, present)","options":["keeps","is kept","was kept"],"answer":"is kept"},{"q":"The phone ___ in 1876. (invent)","options":["is invented","was invented","invented"],"answer":"was invented"}],"speak":["Say: This school was built in... Kyrgyz is spoken in...","Tell how tea/bread is made, using the passive."]},{"id":"reported-speech","title":"Reported speech","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Кыйыр сөз (reported speech)","when_ky":"Бирөөнүн сөзүн ошол бойдон эмес, өзүбүздүн сөз менен жеткирип айтканда колдонобуз: Ал мага «Мен чарчадым» деди. - Ал чарчаганын айтты.","form":[["said that","He said (that) + чак бир кадам артка"],["Present → Past","am/is → was; V1 → V2; will → would"],["сурактар","He asked if / what... (түз тартип)"]],"rule_ky":"Баяндоочу этиш өткөн чакта болсо (said, told), сөздүн чагы бир кадам артка жылат: Present Simple - Past Simple (I work → he said he worked), Present Continuous - Past Continuous, will - would, can - could, have - had. Ат атоочтор жана убакыт сөздөрү өзгөрөт: I - he/she, now - then, today - that day, tomorrow - the next day. Суроо: He asked, 'Do you like tea?' - He asked if I liked tea. Суроодо тартип кадимки сүйлөмдөй: He asked where I lived.","signal":["said that","told me","asked if"],"examples":[{"en":"'I am tired,' she said. - She said she was tired.","ky":"«Мен чарчадым» деди ал. - Ал чарчаганын айтты."},{"en":"'I will help you,' he said. - He said he would help me.","ky":"«Мен сага жардам берем» деди. - Ал жардам берерин айтты."},{"en":"'I like music,' Tom said. - Tom said he liked music.","ky":"«Мен музыканы жакшы көрөм» деди Том."},{"en":"He asked me if I was hungry.","ky":"Ал менден ачпы экенимди сурады."},{"en":"She told me that she lived in Osh.","ky":"Ал мага Ошто жашаарын айтты."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"She said me she was tired.","right":"She told me she was tired.","why_ky":"tell + адам, say + адам жок (said to me)."},{"wrong":"He asked where did I live.","right":"He asked where I lived.","why_ky":"Кыйыр суроодо түз тартип, do/did жок."},{"wrong":"He said he is tired. (said)","right":"He said he was tired.","why_ky":"said болсо, чак бир кадам артка."}],"exercises":[{"q":"'I am happy,' she said. - She said she ___ happy.","options":["is","was","were"],"answer":"was"},{"q":"'I work here,' he said. - He said he ___ there.","options":["works","worked","work"],"answer":"worked"},{"q":"'I will come,' she said. - She said she ___ come.","options":["will","would","can"],"answer":"would"},{"q":"'I can swim,' he said. - He said he ___ swim.","options":["can","could","cans"],"answer":"could"},{"q":"He ___ me that he was busy.","options":["said","told","asked"],"answer":"told"},{"q":"'Do you like tea?' she asked. - She asked ___ I liked tea.","options":["if","that","what"],"answer":"if"},{"q":"'Where do you live?' he asked. - He asked where I ___.","options":["live","lived","did live"],"answer":"lived"},{"q":"'I am reading,' he said. - He said he ___ reading.","options":["is","was","were"],"answer":"was"},{"q":"She said she ___ tired. (She said: 'I am tired.')","options":["is","was","were"],"answer":"was"},{"q":"'We have a car,' they said. - They said they ___ a car.","options":["have","had","has"],"answer":"had"}],"speak":["Tell what your friend said to you today: He said that...","Report a question: She asked me if..."]},{"id":"relative-clauses","title":"Relative clauses (who, which, that)","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Салыштырмалуу сүйлөмдөр (who, which, that)","when_ky":"Адам же нерсе жөнүндө кошумча маалымат берүү үчүн, же кайсы адам/нерсе экенин так көрсөтүү үчүн колдонобуз: Мен сүйлөшкөн киши мугалим.","form":[["who","адамдар үчүн: the man who lives here"],["which","нерселер үчүн: the book which I read"],["that","адам да, нерсе да: the girl that..."]],"rule_ky":"Who — адамдар үчүн: The woman who lives next door is a doctor. Which — нерселер жана жаныбарлар үчүн: The book which is on the table is mine. That — who жана which ордуна колдонсо болот: The man that called is my uncle. Бул сөз сүйлөмдө подлежащее болсо, ал алынбайт: The girl who is singing is my sister. Whose — кимдики: The boy whose bag is red is my friend.","signal":["who","which","that","whose"],"examples":[{"en":"The man who lives next door is a doctor.","ky":"Коңшу турган киши дарыгер."},{"en":"This is the book which I bought yesterday.","ky":"Бул мен кечээ сатып алган китеп."},{"en":"The girl that is singing is my sister.","ky":"Ыр айтып жаткан кыз - менин карындашым."},{"en":"I have a friend who speaks four languages.","ky":"Менин төрт тил билген досум бар."},{"en":"The boy whose bag is red is my cousin.","ky":"Сумкасы кызыл бала - менин тууганым."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"The man which lives here is old.","right":"The man who lives here is old.","why_ky":"Адам үчүн who (же that)."},{"wrong":"The book who I read is good.","right":"The book which I read is good.","why_ky":"Нерсе үчүн which (же that)."},{"wrong":"The girl who she sings is my sister.","right":"The girl who sings is my sister.","why_ky":"who дан кийин she кайталанбайт."}],"exercises":[{"q":"The man ___ lives here is a teacher.","options":["who","which","whose"],"answer":"who"},{"q":"The book ___ is on the table is mine.","options":["who","which","whom"],"answer":"which"},{"q":"She is a girl ___ loves music.","options":["who","which","whose"],"answer":"who"},{"q":"This is the car ___ I bought last year.","options":["who","that","whose"],"answer":"that"},{"q":"The boy ___ bag is red is my friend.","options":["who","whose","which"],"answer":"whose"},{"q":"I know a woman ___ speaks five languages.","options":["who","which","what"],"answer":"who"},{"q":"The film ___ we watched was interesting.","options":["who","which","whose"],"answer":"which"},{"q":"The dog ___ is barking is mine.","options":["who","that","whose"],"answer":"that"},{"q":"Is this the man ___ you met yesterday?","options":["who","which","whose"],"answer":"who"},{"q":"The phone ___ I lost was new.","options":["who","which","whose"],"answer":"which"}],"speak":["Describe a person: He is a man who...","Describe an object: It is a thing which/that..."]},{"id":"gerund-infinitive","title":"Gerund vs infinitive","level":"A2/B1/B2","title_ky":"Герундий жана инфинитив (V-ing жана to + V)","when_ky":"Бир этиштен кийин келген экинчи этиш V-ing же to + V1 формасында болот. Кайсысы колдонулаары биринчи этишке жараша.","form":[["+ V-ing","enjoy, like, love, finish, stop, mind, avoid"],["+ to V","want, need, decide, hope, plan, learn, would like"],["экөө тең","like, love, start, begin (мааниси дээрлик бирдей)"]],"rule_ky":"Кээ бир этиштерден кийин V-ing келет: enjoy reading, finish working, don't mind waiting, stop talking. Башкаларынан кийин to + V1: want to go, need to study, decide to leave, hope to see, plan to travel, learn to swim. Ошондой эле: предлогдон кийин дайыма V-ing: Thanks for helping. Would like — to + V1: I would like to go. Like, love, start менен экөө тең болот. Stop + V-ing = токтотуу, stop + to V = токтоп бир нерсе кылуу.","signal":["enjoy + -ing","want + to","after prepositions + -ing"],"examples":[{"en":"I enjoy reading books.","ky":"Мен китеп окууну жакшы көрөм."},{"en":"She wants to learn English.","ky":"Ал англис тилин үйрөнгүсү келет."},{"en":"He finished doing his homework.","ky":"Ал үй тапшырмасын бүтүрдү."},{"en":"We decided to go home.","ky":"Биз үйгө кетүүнү чечтик."},{"en":"Thank you for helping me.","ky":"Жардам бергениңизге рахмат."}],"mistakes":[{"wrong":"I enjoy to swim.","right":"I enjoy swimming.","why_ky":"enjoy дан кийин V-ing."},{"wrong":"She wants going home.","right":"She wants to go home.","why_ky":"want дан кийин to + V1."},{"wrong":"He is good at to draw.","right":"He is good at drawing.","why_ky":"Предлогдон кийин V-ing."}],"exercises":[{"q":"I enjoy ___ music.","options":["to listen to","listening to","listen to"],"answer":"listening to"},{"q":"She wants ___ a doctor.","options":["be","to be","being"],"answer":"to be"},{"q":"He finished ___ his room.","options":["to clean","cleaning","clean"],"answer":"cleaning"},{"q":"We decided ___ the museum.","options":["visiting","to visit","visit"],"answer":"to visit"},{"q":"Thank you for ___ me.","options":["to help","helping","help"],"answer":"helping"},{"q":"I need ___ more water.","options":["to drink","drinking","drink"],"answer":"to drink"},{"q":"Would you like ___ tea?","options":["drinking","to drink","drink"],"answer":"to drink"},{"q":"She avoids ___ late.","options":["to be","being","be"],"answer":"being"},{"q":"They hope ___ you soon.","options":["seeing","to see","see"],"answer":"to see"},{"q":"He doesn't mind ___ early.","options":["to get up","getting up","get up"],"answer":"getting up"}],"speak":["Say: I enjoy... I want to... I hope to...","Ask: What do you enjoy doing? What do you want to do?"]}]};
